/* SAM R21 Xplained Pro overlay for the radio RX testbed.
 *
 * The on-board AT86RF233 (SERCOM4 SPI) and LED0 (PA19) come from the base
 * board DTS via the `zephyr,ieee802154` chosen and the `led0` alias, so no
 * extra nodes are needed here. This file exists so the testbed is explicitly
 * samr21-only: there are no overlays for any other board.
 */
